=2 Walkthrough
!Sea Serpent Grotto Composite Updated.png|right|{z:Sea Serpent Grotto} Composite Map
* Talk to {n:Andrause} at (I-8) in {z:Norg}.
* You will be given 3 specific monsters from which you must acquire a {@i:Soul Plate|2477} {i:Soul Plate|Soul Plate|2477} using a {@i:Soultrapper|18721} {p:Soultrapper}.
** {n:Andrause} will offer to sell you a {p:Soultrapper} and 12 {p:Blank Soul Plates|Blank Soul Plate} for 800 Gil.
** You can buy another 12 {p:Blank Soul Plates|Blank Soul Plate} from him each day (after JP Midnight).
** **Note:** he will only accept Soul Plates of monsters found in {z:Sea Serpent Grotto}.
* How to take pictures:
** Equip the Soultrapper into your Ranged slot, and the Blank Soul Plates into your Ammo slot.
** You can then use the Soultrapper via the Inventory onto a target, or alternatively, use a macro line **/item "Soultrapper" <t>** or any equivalent.
** The Soultrapper cannot be used while under the effect of {s:Sneak} or {s:Invisible}.
** Sometimes you'll fail taking a picture. Just try again!
* {n:Andrause} will mention which monsters he's "__investigating__", and depending on the monsters chosen, you may need a {@i:Silver Beastcoin|750} {i:Silver Beastcoin|Silver Beastcoin|750}, {@i:Mtl. Beastcoin|749} {i:Mtl. Beastcoin|Mtl. Beastcoin|749} or {@i:Gold Beastcoin|748} {i:Gold Beastcoin|Gold Beastcoin|748} to gain access to them:
** Monsters found in the open area: {m:Bigclaw} (M-14), {m:Brook Sahagin}, {m:Riparian Sahagin}, {m:Rivulet Sahagin}, {m:Royal Leech}, {m:Undead Bats} and {m:Grotto Pugil}.
** Monsters found behind the **{c=silver:Silver}** Beastcoin door: {m:Grotto Pugil}, {m:Sea Bonze}.
** Monsters found behind the **{c=green:Mythril}** Beastcoin door: {m:Blubber Eyes}, {m:Bog Sahagin}, {m:Marsh Sahagin}, {m:Rock Crab}, {m:Razorjaw Pugil}, {m:Sahagin Parasite}, {m:Swamp Sahagin}.
** Monsters found behind the **{c=#b39700:Gold}** Beastcoin door: {m:Coastal Sahagin}, {m:Devil Manta}, {m:Delta Sahagin}, {m:Dire Bat}, {m:Lagoon Sahagin}, {m:Mousse}, {m:Robber Crab}, {m:Shore Sahagin}.
*** {p:Unity Warp} (125) puts you past the Gold Beastcoin door.
*** {m:Delta Sahagin}'s can sometimes be pulled down into the open area at (J-12, K-12 Map 1) off the ledge from behind the **Ornamental Door** with magic.
* Trade the required {i:Soul Plates|Soul Plate|2477} to him one at a time and he will give you a {@k} {k:Black book} Key Item.
** Should you require another, he will give you one in exchange for 3 more Soul Plates of his choosing.
* Once you have the book, click on the **Outcropping** at (F-10) in {z:Gustav Tunnel} for a cutscene.
* Clicking it a second time will immediately start the next mission and initiate a fight against 3 Tenshodo agents.
** The {k:Black book} is taken once the fight starts, so if you should lose, you will need to acquire another.

